  For detailed information on specific aspects of working with meshes, see:

  - @subpage guides-meshes-creation - Creating meshes from files or programmatically
  - @subpage guides-meshes-connectivity - Understanding connectivity relations
  - @subpage guides-meshes-iteration - Iterating over mesh entities
  - @subpage guides-meshes-queries - Geometric queries and measurements
  - @subpage guides-meshes-io - Input/output operations
  - @subpage guides-meshes-utilities - Advanced utilities and transformations

  @section guides-meshes-see-also See Also

